<%- include('partials/head',{title}) %><%- include('partials/nav') %><%- include('partials/flash') %><main class="wrap page-main"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">STAFF VIEW</div><h1>Admin monitoring.</h1><p>Demo metrics and incident review. Keep this page restricted to trusted staff.</p></div><span class="health-badge health-<%= health.status %>"><i></i><%= health.status %></span></div><div class="stats-grid"><article class="stat-card"><small>Patient accounts</small><strong><%= stats.users %></strong><span>Registered users</span></article><article class="stat-card"><small>Appointments</small><strong><%= stats.appointments %></strong><span>All recorded bookings</span></article><article class="stat-card"><small>Waiting list</small><strong><%= stats.waiting %></strong><span>Active waiting requests</span></article><article class="stat-card"><small>Memory usage</small><strong><%= health.memoryPercent %>%</strong><span>Current monitor estimate</span></article></div><section class="panel admin-tools"><div><h2>Set up demo data</h2><p>Add a sample list of doctors to test the booking workflow.</p></div><form action="/admin/seed-doctors" method="post"><button class="btn" type="submit">Seed demo doctors</button></form></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Incident log</h2><p>Review system events and recovery actions.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/self-healing">Full monitor →</a></div><% if(incidents.length){ %><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Severity</th><th>Incident</th><th>Recovery action</th><th>Review</th></tr></thead><tbody><% incidents.forEach(i=>{ %><tr><td><%= new Date(i.createdAt).toLocaleString() %></td><td><span class="pill pill-<%= i.severity %>"><%= i.severity %></span></td><td><b><%= i.source %></b><small><%= i.message %></small></td><td><%= i.recoveryAction %></td><td><% if(!i.resolved){ %><form action="/admin/resolve/<%= i._id %>" method="post"><button class="btn btn-small btn-outline" type="submit">Mark reviewed</button></form><% }else{ %><span class="muted">Reviewed</span><% } %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% }else{ %><p class="muted">No incidents have been recorded yet.</p><% } %></section><div class="warning-note"><b>Admin setup:</b> after creating your first patient account, promote that account to admin directly in MongoDB by setting its <code>role</code> field to <code>admin</code>. Never expose admin registration publicly.</div></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
